    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 359256493739813262, guid: 3fecf9e8b70e3b34b9680efa81765bd3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '- Transmitters on the left, each assigned with a distinct color.

        -
        Receivers on the right, each assigned with a distinct color (from transmitter).

        -
        Every once in a while, a random transmitter receives a charge.

        -
        Charge is capped for each transmitter, charging beyond the cap destroys the
        charge.

        - Clicking on a transmitter sends a beam to transmit the
        charges to its receiver of the same color.

        - If beams intersect,
        the charges sent by the beams will be destroyed.

        Transmit as many
        charges to the receivers as possible.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1338741864404335610, guid: 3fecf9e8b70e3b34b9680efa81765bd3, type: 3}
